  "conclusion": [
    "Only Bag adds ordinary _process, wholly dragged-guarded by prior444/534 proof; no new ordinary override in the finite new caller/receiver classes. Multilevel base callback remains accounted.",
    "Bowl inherits Food spatial predicate and adds Pet-only global read; Wolper Pet query; Enchanted hasAttackEffect reads precomputed three handler-presence BOOLs; Spear affectsEmpty true/canAffect false. No query emits combat events, writes caches/stats/Timer or calls RNG.",
    "All finite subclasses retain the Item cached-highlight route and inherited readonly secondary/type/activation queries from444; do not require Game hover targets globally absent.",
    "Bowl gated shop RNG and Squirrel pickup/drop pitch are not classified as noop. They are outside these ordinary callee routes; combat pitch remains selected Tape business.",
    "Future actual fullwindow must establish picking/input/controller/focus/drag/rigid branches for new29boundUIDs; no actualUI read or Nativepurity claim here. Candidate31slots only conditional on this Source argument plus future actualwindow."
  ],
